# This directory holds Tauri sidecar binaries for the viben CLI.
# Binaries are built by CI and named according to Tauri's convention:
#   - viben-aarch64-apple-darwin (macOS ARM)
#   - viben-x86_64-apple-darwin (macOS Intel)
#   - viben-x86_64-pc-windows-msvc.exe (Windows)
#   - viben-x86_64-unknown-linux-gnu (Linux)
